# Modo Foco test references. Videos, device dumps and anything derived from them stay local (GBs).
# Allow-list: only this file, the clip manifests and the tools go to git; any new folder or file is ignored by default.
*
!.gitignore
!clips/
!clips/manifest.csv
!clips/horizontal-app-export.json
!tools/
!tools/**

# Ground truth for the Modo Foco lab (tools/lab): small JSON, kept in git so it is never lost again
!labels/
!labels/*.json

# Python caches of the tools
__pycache__/

# FocusBench (tools/lab/ios-bench): data copied in by ios_bench.py prepare, and Xcode's per-user files
tools/lab/ios-bench/FocusBench/Data/
xcuserdata/
